They describe and reproduce these edits to the Project Aloha OnePlus 7T DSDT, which fix problems the upstream
support does not address:

  - GPU:      MSHW1004 panel device added so GPU0 can start
  - Touch:    TSC1 no longer waits for TECC; I2C address set to 0x20
  - Charging: USB-C sink power list set to 5 V / 2.9 A

